Z||000004||WKDFIRO||03-29-2001||01:19 AM||||If its not leaking from the axle seals take it somewhere else. <P>We had someone come to our shop with a "leaking" tranny. He didn't believe them and came to the shop. It turned out some bolts had "mysteriously" come loose on the tranny case. They were quoting this guy $800 to take it out and repair. We wrenched 3 bolts back down and sent him on his way for the cost of a case of beer! <P>I really loved my job back then!<p>[This message has been edited by WKDFIRO (edited 03-29-2001).]||||reg||1
